    "title": "Lewis Central's Nettles to long snap for Iowa Western - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Derek Martin ,\n11 hours ago (Council Bluffs) -- Lewis Central long snapper TJ Nettles is ready to gain collegiate experience at the next level with Iowa Western. Nettles grew up a in a family of specialists with his father a punter and his brother a kicker. “I’ve always been around the specialist craft,” Nettles said.... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
